WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.100
Standing heavy kick hits Ryu as he rises after the back throw.

2
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:01.850
Crouching medium punch links into OD Knuckle.

3
00:00:01.850 --> 00:00:02.900
OD Flash Knuckle launches Ryu at the wall.

4
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:03.500
Light Sand Blast catches Ryu during the juggle.

5
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:04.450
Light Rising Uppercut finishes the conversion.

6
00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:05.900
Luke lands with Ryu knocked down at the corner.
